sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant W as Identity wallet (mObywatel / EUDI)
  participant P as Citizen phone
  participant A as Authority certificate service
  participant R as Home router (relay only)
  participant N as Neighbour phone
  Note over P,A: Registration, once, online (internet or in-person), peace mode
  P->>P: create non-extractable enrollment key in secure element
  P->>W: request verified attributes (name, address)
  W-->>P: signed attributes
  P->>A: enrollment public key + signed attributes
  A->>A: HSM generates key pair, signs citizen certificate (pseudonym, 30 days, classes)
  A-->>P: private key wrapped to enrollment key + citizen certificate
  A->>A: destroy private key copy, publish issuance to transparency log
  P->>P: import key into secure element
  Note over P,A: Renewal, no internet: request forwarded by mesh to a gateway, receipt returned along path
  Note over P,N: Any later time, any mode, no network needed
  P->>P: sign request with private key
  P->>R: request + certificate (BLE / Wi-Fi)
  R->>R: verify chain with embedded Authority root key
  R->>R: check message id, TTL, hop limit, class vs mode, rate limit
  R->>N: forward with hop+1 (a relay never originates)
  N->>N: verify offline the same way, show request
  N->>R: signed acceptance
  R->>P: acceptance back along recorded path
  Note over R: Anything signed by a relay certificate that is not topology gossip is dropped
